OL,4,Ain France, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the first time any arrests have
OL,7,Fbeen made in relation to alleged abuse
OL,8,Fand trafficking by the former Harrods
OL,9,Fand Ritz owner.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
