OL,3,AUS House blocks bid to impeach Defence
OL,4,ASecretary Pete Hegseth, for now
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn effort to impeach US Defence
OL,7,FSecretary Pete Hegseth, accusing him of
OL,8,Fwaging war on Iran without
OL,9,Fcongressional authorisation, has failed
OL,10,Fon Capitol Hill.
OL,12,FA majority of the House of
OL,13,FRepresentatives agreed to refer
OL,14,Fimpeachment articles to a committee -
OL,15,Fessentially killing the effort
OL,16,Fintroduced by dissident Republican
OL,17,Fcongressman Thomas Massie of Kentucky -
OL,18,Ffor now.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
