OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle back in
OL,4,Afederal custody after allegedly
OL,5,Aremoving ankle monitor
OL,6,
OL,7,FThomas Markle, the father of Meghan,
OL,8,FDuchess of Sussex, is back in federal
OL,9,Fcustody in Florida after allegedly
OL,10,Fremoving his ankle monitor, according
OL,11,Fto court documents.
OL,13,FMarkle appeared before a federal
OL,14,Fmagistrate judge in the Florida city of
OL,15,FTampa on Tuesday and was denied bond.
OL,16,FProsecutors say he removed the monitor
OL,17,Fearly that morning.
OL,19,FUS Judge Lindsay S Griffin found on
OL,20,FTuesday that Markle had violated the
OL,21,Fconditions of his pretrial release,
OL,22,Fcourt documents show.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
