OL,3,A'It can kill us': Kenyans fear impact
OL,4,Aof El Nino with floods predicted
OL,5,
OL,6,FTucked out of sight is a photo of her
OL,7,Fsister Beatrice Khalayi, 58, who died
OL,8,Fwhen intense rains caused widespread
OL,9,Fdestruction in Kibera. She was among
OL,10,Fmore than 60 people across the country
OL,11,Fwho lost their lives.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
